  },
  "question": {
    "text": "A <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>72</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#937;</mi></math> galvanometer is shunted by a resistance of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>8</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#937;</mi></math>. The percentage of the total current which passes through the galvanometer is&nbsp;"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>%</mo></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>10</mn><mo>%</mo></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>25</mn><mo>%</mo></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>25</mn><mo>%</mo></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "B"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img src=\"assets\\st0169_b4cea2bf14b4.png\" style=\"width: 213px; height: 120px;\" /></p><p>Let&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>G</mi></math> be resistance of galvanometer and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>I</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></math>&nbsp;be the current passing through the galvanometer produces full scale deflection. If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>I</mi></math> is the maximum current, and since, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>G</mi></math> and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>S</mi></math> are in parallel so, the potential difference between them will be same.</p><p>Then,</p><p>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>I</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mi>G</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>I</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi>S</mi><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>72</mn><msup><mi>I</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><msub><mi>I</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi>I</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn><msup><mi>I</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>I</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>I</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><msup><mi>I</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup></math></p><p>So the percentage of total current passes through galvanometer&nbsp;is&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><msup><mi>I</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mi>I</mi></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>100</mn></math><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>I</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mrow><mn>10</mn><msup><mi>I</mi><mo>'</mo></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>100</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>%</mo></math></p>"
  }
}